            "body": "<p>ORI's GVM packages are backed by Federal Second Stage of Manufacture (SSM) certification. When these upgrades are applied pre-registration, the modifications—which can include significant suspension lifts (up to 6 inches on some models) and larger tires (up to 35\" or 37\")—are baked directly into your vehicle's federal compliance plate. This ensures your rig is 100% road-legal, safe, and fully insurable across every state and territory in Australia without the need for state-by-state engineering sign-offs</p>",
